Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 19:35:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] feat(xalarm): add event registration and switch
 management

  - Add event ID transmission from client to server on registration
  - Server opens event switches when clients subscribe
  - Add event aggregation mechanism to track subscriptions per event

  Protocol:
  - JSON format: {"action": "register_events", "event_ids": [1001, ...]}
  - Sent immediately after Unix socket connection established
